---
// Migrated verbatim from public/topics/clearone-interview/lessons/0001-clearone-playbook.html (URL unchanged: builds to 0001-clearone-playbook.html).
// Body is is:raw: braces/inline scripts/JSON blocks pass through untouched.
import Lesson from "../../../../layouts/Lesson.astro";
const titlePt = "ClearOne Advantage — playbook · 8 de agosto de 2026";
const titleEn = "ClearOne Advantage — playbook · 8 August 2026";
const titleFallback = "ClearOne Advantage — seu playbook";
const bodyClass = "lang-pt";
const viewport = "width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0";
const assets = [
	"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/style.css\" />",
	"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/dark.css\" />",
	"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/i18n.css\" />",
	"<script src=\"../assets/i18n.js\" defer></script>",
	"<script src=\"../assets/nav.js\" defer></script>",
];
const pageStyle = ".brief-grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n        gap: 12px;\n        margin-top: 14px;\n      }\n      .brief-grid .card h4 {\n        margin: 0 0 4px;\n        color: var(--violet);\n        font-family: \"Space Grotesk\";\n      }\n      .brief-grid .card p {\n        margin: 0;\n        color: var(--ink-soft);\n        font-size: 0.88rem;\n      }\n      .pitch {\n        background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--violet-50), var(--teal-50));\n        border: 1px solid var(--line);\n        border-radius: var(--radius);\n        padding: 16px 18px;\n        margin: 14px 0;\n      }\n      .pitch .lbl {\n        font: 700 0.62rem \"Space Grotesk\";\n        letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        color: var(--violet);\n      }\n      .pitch blockquote {\n        margin: 6px 0 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        border: 0;\n        color: var(--ink);\n        font-size: 0.96rem;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n      }\n      .pitch blockquote::before {\n        content: \"“\";\n        color: var(--violet);\n        font-size: 1.4rem;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        margin-right: 2px;\n      }\n      .pitch blockquote::after {\n        content: \"”\";\n        color: var(--violet);\n      }\n      .gap {\n        background: var(--amber-50);\n        border: 1px solid #5a4416;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        padding: 12px 14px;\n        margin: 10px 0;\n      }\n      .gap b {\n        color: var(--amber);\n      }\n      .gap p {\n        margin: 4px 0 0;\n        color: var(--ink-soft);\n        font-size: 0.9rem;\n      }\n      details.qa {\n        background: var(--paper-2);\n        border: 1px solid var(--line);\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        padding: 13px 16px;\n        margin: 10px 0;\n        box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      }\n      details.qa summary {\n        cursor: pointer;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: var(--ink);\n        min-height: 44px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 6px;\n      }\n      details.qa summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      details.qa summary::before {\n        content: \"▶ \";\n        color: var(--violet);\n        display: inline-block;\n        transition: transform 0.15s;\n      }\n      details.qa[open] summary::before {\n        transform: rotate(90deg);\n      }\n      details.qa .ans {\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        padding-top: 10px;\n        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n        color: var(--ink-soft);\n        font-size: 0.92rem;\n      }\n      details.qa .ans .story {\n        color: var(--teal);\n        font-weight: 700;\n      }\n      details.qa .ans .hook {\n        display: block;\n        margin-top: 6px;\n        color: var(--ink);\n      }\n      .checklist {\n        list-style: none;\n        padding: 0;\n        margin: 14px 0;\n        display: grid;\n        gap: 8px;\n      }\n      .checklist li {\n        padding-left: 28px;\n        position: relative;\n        color: var(--ink-soft);\n      }\n      .checklist li::before {\n        content: \"☐\";\n        position: absolute;\n        left: 0;\n        color: var(--violet);\n        font-weight: 700;\n      }\n      @media (max-width: 640px) {\n        .brief-grid {\n          grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        }\n      }\n      @media print {\n        details.qa {\n          break-inside: avoid;\n        }\n        details.qa .ans {\n          display: block;\n        }\n      }";

---
<Lesson
	titlePt={titlePt}
	titleEn={titleEn}
	titleFallback={titleFallback}
	bodyClass={bodyClass}
	viewport={viewport}
	assets={assets}
	pageStyle={pageStyle}
>
	<Fragment is:raw>
    <article class="lesson">
      <header class="hero">
        <span class="eyebrow"
          ><span data-lang="pt"
            >⬡ ClearOne Advantage · Sr Full-Stack · 8 ago 2026</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >⬡ ClearOne Advantage · Sr Full-Stack · 8 Aug 2026</span
          ></span
        >
        <h1>
          <span data-lang="pt">Seu playbook da entrevista.</span
          ><span data-lang="en">Your interview playbook.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Foco comportamental, sob medida para a ClearOne. Missão, pitch,
            qual história usar para cada tema — e como tratar os gaps do stack
            com honestidade sênior. Use o botão EN para ensaiar as respostas em
            inglês.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >Behavioral focus, tailored to ClearOne. Mission, pitch, which story
            to use for each theme — and how to handle the stack gaps with senior
            honesty. Rehearse these answers out loud tonight.</span
          >
        </p>
        <p class="lesson-nav-top">
          ↑
          <a href="../MISSION.md"
            ><span data-lang="pt">Missão</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Mission</span></a
          >
          · <span data-lang="pt">seus stories:</span
          ><span data-lang="en">your stories:</span>
          <a href="../../behavioral-interview/my-stories.md">my-stories.md</a> ·
          <a href="../../behavioral-interview/lessons/0002-the-dojo.html"
            ><span data-lang="pt">Dojo (ensaio)</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Dojo (rehearse)</span></a
          >
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- 🆕 LATEST INTEL (post-mock + drill) -->
      <div class="callout key" style="margin-top: 18px">
        <p>
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >🆕
            <strong
              >Atualizado depois do mock + drill. Leia isto primeiro.</strong
            ></span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >🆕
            <strong
              >Updated after the mock + drill. Read this first.</strong
            ></span
          >
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            ><strong>Melhor história por tema (atualizado):</strong></span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            ><strong>Best story by theme (refreshed):</strong></span
          >
        </p>
        <ul
          style="
            margin: 4px 0 10px;
            padding-left: 20px;
            color: var(--ink-soft);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
          "
        >
          <li>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              ><strong>“Simplificar vs construir para escala”</strong> (o bullet
              exato da vaga) → <strong>história do CRM</strong> (4→2 papéis de
              aprovação, admin sobrecarregado, feature flags). Punchline:
              <em
                >“desbloqueie primeiro, escale depois — nesta ordem.”</em
              ></span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              ><strong>“Simplify vs build for scale”</strong> (the JD's exact
              bullet) → <strong>the CRM story</strong> (4→2 approval roles,
              overwhelmed admin, feature flags). Punchline:
              <em
                >“unblock first, then make it scalable — in that order.”</em
              ></span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >AI-first / Next.js / cross-funcional →
              <strong>Story #5 MyBetterAI</strong> (construiu um SaaS de IA em
              Next.js App Router + RSC, com designer + founder).</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >AI-first / Next.js / cross-functional →
              <strong>Story #5 MyBetterAI</strong> (built an AI SaaS on Next.js
              App Router + RSC, with the designer + founder).</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Mentoria → #2 (Cencosud) <strong>ou Textus</strong> (júnior:
              “ensine a fazer as perguntas certas, não dê a resposta”).</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Mentorship → #2 (Cencosud) <strong>or Textus</strong> (junior:
              “teach them to ask the right questions, don't hand the
              answer”).</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Desacordo → <strong>CRM</strong> ou
              <strong>refatoração de code-style</strong> (“entendi o raciocínio
              dele, argumentei pelo contexto, fiz ser a decisão do time”).</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Disagreement → <strong>CRM</strong> or
              <strong>code-style refactor</strong> (“engaged his reasoning,
              argued from context, made it the team's call”).</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin: 6px 0">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            ><strong>Toda resposta termina num takeaway:</strong>
            <em>“A regra que eu sigo agora é…”</em> — cheat-sheet completo em
            <a href="../../behavioral-interview/my-stories.md">my-stories.md</a
            >.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            ><strong>Every answer ends on a takeaway:</strong>
            <em>“The rule I now follow is…”</em> — full cheat-sheet in
            <a href="../../behavioral-interview/my-stories.md">my-stories.md</a
            >.</span
          >
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 6px 0">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            ><strong>“Por que está saindo?”:</strong>
            <em
              >“Consultoria; meu último engajamento terminou numa redução por
              necessidade de negócio — bem avaliado, não performance. Estou indo
              para CLT para ter ownership de plataformas a longo prazo —
              mission-driven, AI-first — por isso a ClearOne.”</em
            ></span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            ><strong>“Why leaving?”:</strong>
            <em
              >“Consulting; my last engagement ended in a business-driven
              reduction — rated highly, not performance. I'm moving to full-time
              to own platforms long-term — mission-driven, AI-first — which is
              why ClearOne.”</em
            ></span
          >
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 6px 0 0">
          <span data-lang="pt"
            ><strong>Stack quick-ref:</strong>
            <a href="./0002-stack-cheatsheet.html">lição 2</a> — React / Node /
            TypeScript / Next.js (RSC + os dois routers).</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            ><strong>Stack quick-ref:</strong>
            <a href="./0002-stack-cheatsheet.html">lesson 2</a> — React / Node /
            TypeScript / Next.js (RSC + the two routers).</span
          >
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- §1 BRIEFING -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">1</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">A empresa em 30 segundos</span
        ><span data-lang="en">The company in 30 seconds</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="kicker">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Fintech <strong>mission-driven</strong> de alívio de dívidas. Eles
          vão querer ver fit com a missão — então saiba disto de cor.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >A <strong>mission-driven</strong> debt-relief fintech. They'll want
          to see mission fit — so know this cold.</span
        >
      </p>
      <div class="brief-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">O que fazem</span
            ><span data-lang="en">What they do</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Renegociam dívidas de cartão/desseguradas com credores para o
              cliente pagar <strong>menos</strong>,
              <strong>sem falência pessoal</strong>,
              <strong>sem taxa antecipada</strong>.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Negotiate card/unsecured debt with creditors so clients pay
              <strong>less</strong>,
              <strong>without personal bankruptcy</strong>,
              <strong>no upfront fees</strong>.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">Missão</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Mission</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            “<span data-lang="pt"
              >Ajudar pessoas endividadas a encontrar um caminho claro para a
              estabilidade financeira.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Help people in debt find a clear path to financial
              stability.</span
            >”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">Fatos</span><span data-lang="en">Facts</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              >Fundada 2008 · sede Baltimore · 500+ funcionários · remote-first
              · aporte da Comvest Partners (fev/2024).</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >Founded 2008 · HQ Baltimore · 500+ employees · remote-first ·
              Comvest Partners growth capital (Feb 2024).</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>
            <span data-lang="pt">Stack (vaga)</span
            ><span data-lang="en">Stack (JD)</span>
          </h4>
          <p>
            React · Node · AWS serverless (Lambda, API Gateway, S3, CloudWatch)
            · TypeScript · Next.js · Postgres/NoSQL · <strong>AI-first</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cite">
        <span data-lang="pt">Fontes:</span><span data-lang="en">Sources:</span>
        <a
          href="https://www.clearoneadvantage.com/about-us"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          >clearoneadvantage.com/about-us</a
        >
        ·
        <a
          href="https://www.clearoneadvantage.com/how-it-works"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          >/how-it-works</a
        >
      </p>

      <!-- §2 PITCH -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">2</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Seu pitch (diga isto)</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Your pitch (say this)</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="pitch">
        <div class="lbl">
          <span data-lang="pt">“Conte sobre você” — BLUF (~30s)</span
          ><span data-lang="en">“Tell me about yourself” — BLUF (~30s)</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote>
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Sou engenheiro full-stack sênior — React, Node, TypeScript — e
            tenho ownership de plataformas de alto volume ponta a ponta. Na
            Cencosud construí um serviço Node que ingeria milhões de eventos de
            entrega por dia, e liderei a reescrita de uma UI React com um time
            pequeno. A ClearOne me atrai pela missão real — tirar pessoas de
            dívida sem falência — e pelo desafio de plataforma
            (marketing/onboarding/servicing em escala, com mindset
            AI-first).</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >I'm a senior full-stack engineer — React, Node, TypeScript — who's
            owned high-volume platforms end to end. At Cencosud I built a Node
            service ingesting millions of delivery events a day, and I led a
            React rebuild with a small team. ClearOne draws me because the
            mission is real — getting people out of debt without bankruptcy —
            and the platform work (marketing/onboarding/servicing at scale,
            AI-first) is exactly what I want to own.</span
          >
        </blockquote>
      </div>
      <div class="pitch">
        <div class="lbl">
          <span data-lang="pt">“Por que a ClearOne?”</span
          ><span data-lang="en">“Why ClearOne?”</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote>
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Missão + desafio de engenharia: iterar em plataformas que tocam
            clientes em dificuldade financeira, em escala, com AI-first. É onde
            meu background de alto volume + liderança técnica se cruza com um
            trabalho que importa.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            >Mission + engineering challenge: iterating on platforms that serve
            clients in financial hardship, at scale, AI-first. That's where my
            high-volume background + technical leadership meets work that
            matters.</span
          >
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- §3 STORY MAP -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">3</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">O mapa: tema → sua história</span
        ><span data-lang="en">The map: theme → your story</span>
      </h2>
      <div
        class="table-wrap"
        style="
          margin: 14px 0;
          overflow-x: auto;
          border: 1px solid var(--line);
          border-radius: var(--radius);
          background: var(--paper-2);
          box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        "
      >
        <table
          class="compare-table"
          style="
            width: 100%;
            min-width: 620px;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.86rem;
          "
        >
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th
                style="
                  padding: 10px;
                  text-align: left;
                  background: var(--violet-50);
                "
              >
                <span data-lang="pt">Eles vão perguntar…</span
                ><span data-lang="en">They'll ask…</span>
              </th>
              <th style="padding: 10px; background: var(--violet-50)">
                <span data-lang="pt">Use</span><span data-lang="en">Use</span>
              </th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt"
                  >Projeto do qual se orgulha / ponta a ponta</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Proudest project / end-to-end</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#1 Ingest</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Escalou um sistema / lidou com pico</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Scaled a system / handled a spike</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#1</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Simplificar vs. construir para escala</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Simplify vs. build for scale</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">CRM story</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Mentoria / liderança de pares</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Mentorship / peer leadership</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#2</b>
                <span data-lang="pt">ou</span><span data-lang="en">or</span>
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">Textus</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Cross-funcional (Product/Design)</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Cross-functional (Product/Design)</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#5 MyBetterAI</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Mindset AI-first</span
                ><span data-lang="en">AI-first mindset</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#5</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Next.js / SSR</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Next.js / SSR</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#5 MyBetterAI</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Maior fraqueza</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Greatest weakness</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#3</b>
                <span data-lang="pt">ou</span><span data-lang="en">or</span>
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#4</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Falha / erro</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Failure / mistake</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#4 MV3</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Empurrou de volta / discordou</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Pushed back / disagreed</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">CRM</b>
                <span data-lang="pt">ou</span><span data-lang="en">or</span>
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">code-style</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Decisão técnica justificada</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Tech decision justified</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)">#1</b>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <span data-lang="pt">Por que está saindo?</span
                ><span data-lang="en">Why leaving?</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 9px 10px">
                <b style="color: var(--teal)"
                  ><span data-lang="pt">redução → CLT</span
                  ><span data-lang="en">reduction → full-time</span></b
                >
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="kicker" style="margin-top: 8px">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Stories detalhados (BLUF + S/T/A/R + probes) em </span
        ><span data-lang="en">Full stories (BLUF + S/T/A/R + probes) in </span
        ><a href="../../behavioral-interview/my-stories.md">my-stories.md</a>.
      </p>

      <!-- §4 TECH-JUDGMENT -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">4</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Juízo técnico (falado como comportamental)</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Technical judgment (as behavioral)</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="callout key">
        <p>
          <strong
            >“<span data-lang="pt"
              >Quando simplificar vs. construir para escala?</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              >When do you simplify vs. build for scale?</span
            >”</strong
          >
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Direito-tamanho para o time e a carga — Node sobre Java para ingest
            I/O-heavy (#1); e aprendi o oposto: no MV3 (#4) eu otimizei para uma
            data, não para qualidade. Regra: não construir para escala que você
            ainda não tem.</span
          >
          <span data-lang="en"
            >Right-size to the team and the load — Node over Java for I/O-heavy
            ingest (#1); and I learned the inverse: in MV3 (#4) I optimized for
            a date, not for quality. Rule: don't build for scale you don't have
            yet.</span
          >
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="callout key">
        <p>
          <strong
            >“<span data-lang="pt">Como você usa assistentes de IA?</span
            ><span data-lang="en">How do you use AI coding assistants?</span
            >”</strong
          >
          <span data-lang="pt"
            >Rampo em codebases desconhecidos: mapeio, peço para explicar
            idiomas, gero testes para validar meu entendimento. AI-first =
            alavancar velocidade sem perder ownership.</span
          >
          <span data-lang="en"
            >I ramp on unfamiliar codebases with AI: I map it, ask it to explain
            idioms, generate tests to validate my understanding. AI-first =
            lifting leverage without losing ownership.</span
